      "summary": "The Terraform currently configures the ACR endpoint and identities as intended, but the registry test does not verify that the endpoint targets the ACR resource itself.",
      "findingList": [
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "infra/terraform/tests/identity-telemetry.tftest.hcl",
          "line": 188,
          "message": "Assert that the ACR private endpoint's private_connection_resource_id equals the ACR resource ID; the current test can pass when the endpoint targets another resource.",
          "confidence": 0.96,
          "category": "other",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The registry test checks the private endpoint's subresource and DNS zone, but does not check private_service_connection[0].private_connection_resource_id.",
            "failureScenario": "If local.private_endpoints.acr.resource_id is changed to the Container App ID while its subresource remains \"registry\" and its zone remains \"acr\", the endpoint targets the wrong resource but these assertions still pass. AC RELEASE-ID-01 requires that mismatch to fail the test."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "agentId": "test-reviewer-codex",
      "reviewType": "testing",
      "harness": "codex",
      "harnessVersion": "0.162.0",
